{[#]} 1. Rh1# {The checkmate is named after the famous Italian checkmate
cataloguerGioachino Greco. It works by using the bishop to contain the black
king by use of the black g-pawn and subsequently using thequeen or a rook to
checkmate the king by moving it to the edge of theboard.} *

